    "body": "Functions worked on DV8 Notebook. Minor documentation issues. The R/download.R copyleft has to be re-added. Not sure why it was removed. \r\n\r\nWas hoping to merge before the addition of network/R and graph/R in progress functions but that is fine, since the others from 3.4 Milestone are still around. We can work on refining them in a follow-up issue. \r\n\r\nIn retrospect, Milestone 3.4 functions, given their complexity and reliance on other Kaiaulu functions which bugs were identified, should have likely be a separate PR to avoid this one growing too long.",
